	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d11r0101_swchampion_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>アイリス『あのね　ほんとうに
プラズマだんが　いるかも　しれないし▼
それに　やせいポケモンも　いるから
いっしょに　いこうよ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>アイリス『あのね　本当に
プラズマ団が　いるかも　しれないし▼
それに　野生ポケモンも　いるから
一緒に　いこうよ？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-09T09:04:52" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・連れ歩き確認
・はい/いいえの選択肢表示
　はい　→swchampion_03
　いいえ→swchampion_02</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWCHAMPION
チャンピオン・アイリス</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-06-21T11:45:23" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Width">
			<Text>256</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ariizumi_nobuhiko:W00248"
				Time="2011-05-20T09:30:13" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<ExtraCell
			DataHolder="f803f354-0c78-4e1d-a1a9-1525faa0efba">
			<CellData>#404040</CellData>
			<CellModifiedBy
				User=":"
